    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Client Brand Meta Ad Automation\n\n**Runs every Monday at 8:00 AM**\n\n1. Fetches all assets from Client Brand/Ads folder in Google Drive\n2. Selects the most recently added file\n3. Uploads creative to Meta Marketing API\n4. Creates a PAUSED draft ad in Meta Ads Manager\n5. Notifies team via Slack and email\n\n**⚠️ IMPORTANT:**\nNothing ever goes live automatically. All ads are created in PAUSED status and require human approval in Meta Ads Manager before publishing.\n\n**Error Handling:**\nEvery external API call has error handling. If upload or ad creation fails, admin receives email alerts with error details.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 2700,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "8f8193f8-c039-4734-aca3-da50bd0da94d",
      "name": "Sticky Note dab7566b",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
